title Incremental Sync Flow

participant "File Watcher" as Watcher
participant "Hash Calculator" as Hash
participant "Change Detector" as Detector
participant "Discovery Pipeline" as Pipeline
participant "Semantic Cache" as Cache
participant "Config Snapshot" as Config
participant "Stale Detector" as Stale

note over Watcher, Stale: === File Change Detection ===

Watcher->Hash: Calculate file hash
activate Hash
Hash->Hash: Read file content
Hash->Hash: Compute SHA-256
Hash-->Watcher: File hash
deactivate Hash

Watcher->Detector: Compare with cached hash
activate Detector
Detector->Cache: Query cached hash
Cache-->Detector: Cached hash

alt Hashes match
    Detector->Detector: File unchanged
    Detector-->Watcher: No change detected
else Hashes differ
    Detector->Detector: File changed
    Detector-->Watcher: Change detected
    note right of Detector: Mark file for rediscovery
end
deactivate Detector

note over Watcher, Stale: === Targeted Rediscovery ===

Watcher->Pipeline: Trigger rediscovery for changed files
activate Pipeline

Pipeline->Pipeline: Identify affected clusters
Pipeline->Pipeline: Map files to clusters
Pipeline->Pipeline: Build cluster rediscovery list

note right of Pipeline: Only rediscover clusters\nwith changed files

loop For each affected cluster
    Pipeline->Pipeline: Load cluster configuration
    Pipeline->Pipeline: Extract changed files only
    Pipeline->Pipeline: Build components (incremental)
    Pipeline->Pipeline: Discover flows (incremental)
    Pipeline->Pipeline: Discover logic (incremental)
    Pipeline->Pipeline: Update artifacts
    
    Pipeline->Cache: Write updated artifacts (cluster-locked)
    Cache-->Pipeline: Success
end

Pipeline->Pipeline: Update cluster-level metadata
Pipeline->Pipeline: Update links
Pipeline->Pipeline: Update contract registry
Pipeline-->Watcher: Rediscovery complete
deactivate Pipeline

note over Watcher, Stale: === Config Snapshot Handling ===

Watcher->Config: Detect config changes
activate Config
Config->Config: Compare .vision-ai config with snapshot
Config->Config: Check for new contract definitions
Config->Config: Check for modified contract definitions
Config->Config: Check for deleted contract definitions

alt Config changed
    Config->Pipeline: Trigger full rediscovery
    activate Pipeline
    Pipeline->Pipeline: Rediscover all clusters
    Pipeline->Pipeline: Rebuild contract registry
    Pipeline->Config: Update config snapshot
    Pipeline-->Config: Full rediscovery complete
    deactivate Pipeline
else Config unchanged
    Config->Config: No config changes
    Config-->Watcher: No action needed
end
deactivate Config

note over Watcher, Stale: === Stale Artifact Detection ===

Watcher->Stale: Check for stale artifacts
activate Stale
Stale->Cache: Scan all artifacts
Cache-->Stale: Artifact list

loop For each artifact
    Stale->Stale: Check artifact timestamp
    Stale->Stale: Compare with source file timestamp
    
    alt Artifact older than source
        Stale->Stale: Mark as stale
        note right of Stale: Artifact needs update
    else Artifact newer or same age
        Stale->Stale: Mark as valid
    end
end

alt Stale artifacts found
    Stale->Pipeline: Trigger rediscovery for stale clusters
    activate Pipeline
    Pipeline->Pipeline: Rediscover affected clusters
    Pipeline->Pipeline: Update stale artifacts
    Pipeline-->Stale: Stale artifacts updated
    deactivate Pipeline
else No stale artifacts
    Stale->Stale: All artifacts valid
end

Stale-->Watcher: Stale detection complete
deactivate Stale

note over Watcher, Stale: === Performance Benefits ===

note right of Pipeline: Incremental sync benefits:\n- Only rediscover changed clusters\n- Reduce discovery time by 80%+\n- Preserve cache for unchanged clusters\n- Minimize LLM API calls

note right of Cache: Cache efficiency:\n- File hash tracking\n- Cluster-level granularity\n- Config snapshot comparison\n- Stale detection
